        +
SPECIAL ACHIEVEMENT
        +
STORY PROGRESSION
        ↓
MASTER PROGRESSION SCORE
        ↓
MASTER LEVEL
```

Master Level tidak harus sama persis dengan nomor Floor.

Contoh:

```text
Floor 1
→ Master Level 1

Floor 5
→ Master Level 3

Floor 10
→ Master Level 5

Floor 20
→ Master Level 10

Floor 30
→ Master Level 15

Floor 50
→ Master Level 25

Floor 75
→ Master Level 35

Floor 100
→ Master Level 50+
```

Angka tersebut adalah **contoh balancing** dan dapat diubah melalui konfigurasi Game State System.

