# 11. FACILITY UPGRADE REQUIREMENT

Untuk menaikkan fasilitas, sistem dapat membutuhkan:

```text
Master Level
+
Required Floor
+
Gold
+
Materials
+
Required Item
+
Required Leader
```

Contoh:

```text
BLACKSMITH Lv.2 → Lv.3

Requirements:

Master Lv.10
Floor 10 Cleared
Gold
Iron
Rare Material
Blacksmith Leader
```

Jika salah satu requirement tidak terpenuhi:

```text
UPGRADE LOCKED
```

