# 12. FACILITY LEADER REQUIREMENT

Mengikuti Town Square System:

> **Fasilitas tanpa Leader tidak dapat beroperasi.**

Maka:

```text
FACILITY UNLOCKED
        ≠
FACILITY ACTIVE
```

Fasilitas membutuhkan:

```text
Facility
+
Leader
```

agar dapat bekerja.

